 Pass  \n liu-zihao35, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161383118,"discussion_id":"a77b0218daabdb6db3d2f9eaa9936200a59eecb8","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161383199,"discussion_id":"b1e254b30c90e336ece737e10878cb8dcef5ca39","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复ScatterPaKvCache算子中ROPE模板在双输入输出（DUAL_IN_OUT）模式下的平铺（tiling）逻辑错误。原代码在处理该模式时，因错误地提前返回，导致用于计算Value（V）的关键平铺参数未被正确初始化，可能引发后续计算错误或性能问题。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n调整了`TemplateRope`函数中针对`DUAL_IN_OUT`模式的处理逻辑。将原本导致提前返回的语句移除，并将计算V相关平铺参数的关键代码从`if`代码块外移至其内部。这确保了在该模式下，K和V的平铺参数都能被正确计算和设置，从而修复了逻辑缺陷。","created_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:56+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-27T17:19:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161383750,"discussion_id":"a77fb5993e52a4dd0ff4243072150a6f5057c027","body":"compile","cre